{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0424_1000_404apr", "source_sha256": "fcded5cbded2f010531c021f3d8a3f26e12f5b9e4046898af48e847e3960f387", "ja": "（環達3人のステージが終わった。\n意外な選曲に、ファンの人達も驚いてたみたいだ）", "zh": "（环她们这3人的舞台结束了。没想到会选那首歌，粉丝们似乎也很惊讶。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0424_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "bc53c3f873ade84736bb530aca3620d15c352b5efaf5b6aefb103227e9b231cf", "ja": "おやぶんおやぶんおやぶーん！\nねえねえ、たまきたちのステージどうだった！？", "zh": "老大老大老大——！\n呐呐，环和大家的舞台怎么样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0424_1002_404apr", "source_sha256": "291eed62f24ec2d5ea56c3217b53f2bf46c5590d171beb7147f5322cf0b0e5af", "ja": "お～。ステージが終わったばっかりなのに、\n環は元気だな～。", "zh": "哦～明明才刚结束演出，环还真有精神啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0424_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "223ba927a5a2bd9c23538b6d8e481e4c60d9f6a153b6480ea24ef35504d7f66a", "ja": "うん、元気！！！\nおやぶんは、元気じゃないの？　疲れてる？", "zh": "嗯，超有精神！！！\n老大你没精神吗？很累吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0424_1004_404apr", "source_sha256": "9347eaa57c433d9ba50a8dd935e46cf27e0d122c84002ddb13132907fffbfeb2", "ja": "俺は環たちのステージで、元気をもらったからな～。\n環は、ライブ楽しかったか？", "zh": "我在环她们的舞台上获得了力量嘛～。\n环，你觉得演出开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0424_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "6a979f8b277148a2d170cd4c82cd0916727ee83c352c1eb629f965986d63670e", "ja": "すっごく楽しかった！　ファンのみんなが、\nい～っぱい応援してくれたし……。", "zh": "超级开心！　粉丝们也给了我好多好多鼓励……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0424_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "4f63b99f8f006c02a3b6361101ae136c5f70786177d4e945e4c7fc00b0781dda", "ja": "育とももこと、思いっきりステージを走れて、\nすっごく気持ちよかったぞ～！　くふふ♪", "zh": "能和育还有桃子尽情地在舞台上跑来跑去，感觉真是太棒了～！咯呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0424_1007_404apr", "source_sha256": "196df2606ad18f80009222ef66ead289f1643c9d1df88966a01b2bb5db3b2c10", "ja": "ははは、そうか。\n3人とも、すっかり仲良しだな～。", "zh": "哈哈，是吗。\n你们3个人已经完全成了好朋友啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0424_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "d412879e40207765b1a5678e7e92004790313954613a2c46ee70bab446dd4a01", "ja": "たまき、覚えてるよ！　はじめてのステージで\n育が泣いちゃって、ももこに注意されたんだぞ～。", "zh": "环记得哦！第一次登台时，育哭了，环还被桃子提醒了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0424_1009_404apr", "source_sha256": "dc6482ee29e58a54e3352166f75d07c37e39dd56b6187c7777ca910ead0a0965", "ja": "そうだったな。まあ、あれはあれで\n良かったのかもしれないけど……。", "zh": "是那样没错。不过，那样或许也挺好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0424_1010_404apr", "source_sha256": "d38f933f6a4ed0ac36fd2420d65069089d6446d4a8471a18d4cd30873874b50d", "ja": "でも、今が一番だって俺は思ってるよ。\n……これも、環と育のおかげだな～。", "zh": "不过，我觉得现在才是最棒的。……这也多亏了环和育啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0424_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "d57341adf22d223f3344c334f70d66a36f422f46ed3090c1f66830a28f1837db", "ja": "……？　たまき、何かしたっけ？", "zh": "……？环，做过什么来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0424_1012_404apr", "source_sha256": "f07972556411b1ac3b77f8f1c1fe0a6119f1836cf9d9492214800d797eb4b6a5", "ja": "そうだな～。いつも元気いっぱいに、\nふたりを引っ張っていってくれたことかな～？", "zh": "是啊～应该是你总是精神满满地带着我们两个人向前走吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0424_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "1de46448f4e058b1797f868495080364051f5d668f9dc2143674dac7ceec1f3b", "ja": "そっか！　……あのね、おやぶん。\nナイショの話してもいい？", "zh": "这样啊！……那个，老大。\n可以跟你说个秘密吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0424_1014_404apr", "source_sha256": "bb9dc71f924caba4019d346d566c2c705c3e90170003b7ab770bd9c0062c5343", "ja": "ん～……？　もちろんいいけど、何かな～？", "zh": "嗯～……？当然可以啊，不过是什么事呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0424_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "b6fac97a3fc71bb2ca531a9c1b89b2d61a80f0c57adcbd092f08a798c0db33ac", "ja": "あのね。たまき、ばあちゃん家からこっちに来て、\n最初のころ、ぜんぜん友達がいなかったでしょ？", "zh": "那个啊。环从奶奶家来这边之后，\n一开始不是完全交不到朋友吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0424_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "ff52959ac72a25f51c64f8f7caf2ed39413766f99e05a5305645603692e51243", "ja": "だから、育とももこに会った時、\nぜったい友達になりたいって思ったんだ～！", "zh": "所以，第一次见到小育和桃子时，环就想和她们成为朋友～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0424_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "981d82c283a0d3ca34dd7e7581115790fb53c3cc18f96ca7df975057c13ca183", "ja": "だから今、すっごく楽しいぞ～！\nレッスンとか、お泊まりとかもできるし……。", "zh": "所以现在特别开心呀～！\n还能一起上课、留宿什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0424_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "fe5653fe61a7dcf8ee3befe9a013f1f636d95755845bd33081477356d3d29540", "ja": "たまきが、友達ができたらやりたい！って\n思ってたことが、いっぱいできてる！", "zh": "环想和朋友一起做的事，已经有好多都实现了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0424_1019_404apr", "source_sha256": "875a09c217e14d3b2bbf4178e8b1810a00d54ab8c62411ed70df0d3842b4b264", "ja": "そうか……よかったな～、環。\nこれからも、いっぱい楽しまなくちゃな。", "zh": "这样啊……那太好了，环。\n今后也要尽情享受才行啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0424_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "717cdf4b7c4476dd6d5f3eed1e79b2cda2d7d714d3f1367483a87e8c348da041", "ja": "うん！　……あ、いけない！\nたまき、おやぶんをむかえにきたんだった！", "zh": "嗯！……啊，糟了！环本来是来接老大的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0424_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "e4e74206fa8df28def23d1d4985e06a4b84d78321ad5a5fa30dcbeb914991610", "ja": "このあとは打ち上げだから、\n着替えて集合だって！", "zh": "接下来要开庆功会，所以说要先换好衣服集合！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0424_1022_404apr", "source_sha256": "b0fdad88930d6afa6dc930d13dfb6c97df46450ba78ea78843cdde29a10160f5", "ja": "うんうん。わかったから、\n環は先に行って着替えておいで。", "zh": "嗯嗯，知道了。所以环先去换衣服吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0424_1023_040tam", "source_sha256": "fcae55bceadd37e3a2d23c3e2fd2de35563afa06b8b74e34d3f222c0b85f91d4", "ja": "はーい！　……おやぶん、たまきのこと、\nアイドルにしてくれてありがとね！　くふふ♪", "zh": "好——！……老大，谢谢你让环成为偶像！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
